  panelId: hud
  title: Your HUD
  body: "<sprite=\"Sword\" index=0> Attack, <sprite=\"shield\" index=0> Defend, <sprite=\"scroll\"
    index=0> Explore, <sprite=\"gem\" index=0> Influence are added to as cards are
    played with the repespective attribute. \n\nUse <sprite=\"scroll\" index=0> during
    Explore phase \u2192 <sprite=\"Sword\" index=0> <sprite=\"shield\" index=0> <sprite=\"gem\"
    index=0> during Action \u2192 End to refill your hand to start the next turn.
    \n\nEach day's length shrinks as <sprite=\"doom\" index=0> Doom climbs; when
    the day ends your deck refills and <sprite=\"doom\" index=0> rises."
